SystemName IsolatedO
SystemLabel IsolatedO

NumberOfSpecies 1
NumberOfAtoms 1

%block ChemicalSpeciesLabel
 1  8  O
%endblock ChemicalSpeciesLabel

PAO.BasisSize DZP
PAO.EnergyShift 0.02 Ry

LatticeConstant 1.0 Ang
%block LatticeVectors
 15.0  0.0  0.0
  0.0 15.0  0.0
  0.0  0.0 15.0
%endblock LatticeVectors

AtomicCoordinatesFormat Fractional
%block AtomicCoordinatesAndAtomicSpecies
 0.5 0.5 0.5  1
%endblock AtomicCoordinatesAndAtomicSpecies

MeshCutOff 250 Ry
MaxSCFIterations 500
XC.Functional GGA
XC.Authors PBE
Spin non-collinear
SCF.Mixer.Weight 0.03
SCF.Mixer.History 10
SCF.DM.Tolerance 5.0d-5 eV
ElectronicTemperature 300.0 meV

MD.Steps 0
WriteCoorInitial .true.
SaveHS .true.

WriteWaveFunctions T
WaveFuncKPointsScale ReciprocalLatticeVectors
%block WaveFuncKPoints
 0.0 0.0 0.0
%endblock WaveFuncKPoints
